#70050
"The Stomach of a Purple Worm"
"The stomach of a purple worm is an extremely unpleasant place.  The walls of
slime covered flesh throb regularly due to the beast's powerful muscle
contractions, and caustic digestive acids rapidly digest any organic matter
that does not belong.  The stench of flesh in various stages of decomposition
fills what passes for air here.
"
